# Test Coverage Targets
RULE: 35% minimum (blocking), 50% recommended (production), 80% goal (audit readiness).
WHY: Quality gates block merge below 35%; production needs 50%; audits need 80%.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/testing.md, .cursor/rules/test-quality-standards.mdc
DO: Focus on core logic for 35%; add edge cases for 50%; complete paths for 80%
NEVER: Skip tests to pass gates; exclude test paths from coverage; target <35%
